Noll: sigma^2 = Delta_J (D / r0)^(5/3). Source: Noll 1976, DOI 10.1364/JOSA.66.000207, Table IV, printed p. 210.
Delta_1 and Delta_3 are the printed values; a larger J takes the asymptotic 0.2944 J^(-sqrt(3)/2).

